WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 34

02:12.930 --> 02:14.690
I know you are there.

02:14.850 --> 02:18.680
It's been ages. You don't change much.

02:18.700 --> 02:20.370
I've lost my memory

02:20.700 --> 02:23.560
and don't remember much about you.

02:27.370 --> 02:29.690
Then why do you come to me?

02:30.730 --> 02:32.350
To fight with you.

02:32.370 --> 02:34.470
What's the reason for that?

02:34.490 --> 02:36.170
Xiao En is returning.

02:36.570 --> 02:38.010
If you stay here

02:38.010 --> 02:39.630
and don't go back to Beiqi,

02:39.650 --> 02:41.560
I can give up the fight.

02:42.010 --> 02:44.850
=Ku He, Great Master of Beiqi=
Xiao En shall not return alive.

02:44.850 --> 02:46.250
Then, let's fight!

02:46.450 --> 02:47.690
Stop!

02:48.060 --> 02:49.530
He is right!

02:51.140 --> 02:52.610
If you accept the fight,

02:52.980 --> 02:54.760
it's hard to survive.

03:49.780 --> 03:51.370
=Haitang Duoduo, Saintess of Beiqi=
Almost got him.

03:55.730 --> 03:58.330
He detected you long time back.

03:59.260 --> 04:00.560
Really?

04:00.780 --> 04:02.520
You were already around me

04:02.540 --> 04:04.730
when I just arrived

04:04.850 --> 04:06.200
and changed direction three times

04:06.450 --> 04:08.120
while we were talking.

04:10.900 --> 04:12.200
Awesome!

04:13.340 --> 04:14.610
Master,

04:15.140 --> 04:16.720
I can't beat this guy.

04:16.890 --> 04:18.420
Go to the territory of Nanqing

04:18.420 --> 04:19.490
and kill Xiao En!

04:19.490 --> 04:21.370
Don't let him return.

04:22.820 --> 04:24.750
Master, you said it too loudly.

04:24.770 --> 04:26.470
He's heard it.

04:26.490 --> 04:28.160
How do I leave?

04:28.580 --> 04:30.250
Anyone can leave

04:30.490 --> 04:32.410
except the Great Master.

04:36.540 --> 04:37.760
Off I go!

04:42.540 --> 04:44.520
Your skin is so fine and smooth.

04:44.540 --> 04:46.240
It's flawless!

04:46.260 --> 04:47.560
What do you use for face care?

04:47.580 --> 04:49.010
Haitang!

04:49.820 --> 04:51.120
I know! I know!

04:51.140 --> 04:52.570
I'm leaving right away!

05:32.170 --> 05:33.720
That's fantastic!

05:35.930 --> 05:40.010
Master, beat him!

05:42.610 --> 05:44.480
He probably can't hear me.

06:25.370 --> 06:27.960
Your Excellency, I settled Xiao En well now.

06:27.980 --> 06:29.070
He is locked right in that carriage.

06:29.090 --> 06:30.750
Two guards are watching over him.

06:30.770 --> 06:32.030
How was it with you?

06:32.050 --> 06:34.280
I've said plenty of witty words

06:34.300 --> 06:35.440
which completely erased

06:35.460 --> 06:37.370
his intent to kill me.

06:55.460 --> 06:58.280
Your Excellency, she has a crush on you.

06:58.300 --> 06:59.020
Nonsense!

06:59.020 --> 07:00.330
She was captured by me.

07:00.330 --> 07:01.640
Your Excellency,

07:02.420 --> 07:03.700
she likes you.

07:03.700 --> 07:04.330
See?

07:04.330 --> 07:06.030
Why are you making fun of me as well?

07:06.050 --> 07:07.410
I'm not!

07:08.210 --> 07:09.820
Anyone can perceive that.

07:09.820 --> 07:11.040
You see?

07:11.300 --> 07:12.590
You don't understand.

07:12.610 --> 07:15.160
She is a prisoner.

07:15.300 --> 07:18.480
Prisoner also has feelings.

07:19.420 --> 07:20.870
It's such a surprise

07:20.890 --> 07:22.680
to hear someone as decent as you

07:22.700 --> 07:25.190
to say wise words like this.

07:25.210 --> 07:28.350
Anyone will naturally understand human mind
as they see more and more people.

07:28.370 --> 07:30.570
We are kindred spirits.

07:30.650 --> 07:31.890
Human mind might be unpredictable,

07:31.890 --> 07:33.300
but it's most valuable to have feelings.

07:33.300 --> 07:34.690
Enough of that.

07:35.140 --> 07:37.050
You two come with me to the room.

07:37.050 --> 07:38.020
You,

07:38.020 --> 07:39.680
repeat every word Xiao En told you

07:39.700 --> 07:40.330
in the exactly

07:40.330 --> 07:41.920
the same way.

07:43.540 --> 07:46.160
May I know how old your wife is?

07:47.140 --> 07:48.570
Words like that

07:48.610 --> 07:49.330
completely erased his hostility

07:49.330 --> 07:51.920
against me.

07:52.370 --> 07:54.720
His tone became much softer.

07:54.740 --> 07:56.930
You are indeed eloquent

07:56.930 --> 07:58.920
and good at psychological tactics.

07:59.420 --> 08:00.910
It's a requisite skill

08:00.930 --> 08:03.120
to survive in the world.

08:03.140 --> 08:04.480
It's the so-called tactic

08:04.650 --> 08:07.020
to use different words towards different targets...

08:07.020 --> 08:08.690
You've done it wrongly.

08:15.260 --> 08:16.480
What?

08:16.980 --> 08:19.690
I said you've done it wrongly.

08:20.540 --> 08:21.760
Your Excellency,

08:22.140 --> 08:23.750
Wang has been neither humble nor pushy

08:23.770 --> 08:24.740
and put his identity

08:24.740 --> 08:26.070
to the lowest.

08:26.090 --> 08:27.800
Xiao En must think

08:27.820 --> 08:28.700
kidnapping him

08:28.700 --> 08:30.280
would not pose any threat to Your Excellency.

08:30.300 --> 08:31.750
So definitely, he won't do it, right?

08:31.770 --> 08:33.400
If I may ask,

08:33.610 --> 08:35.920
which one of them is wrong?

08:38.730 --> 08:40.080
All of them!

08:41.100 --> 08:42.370
All of them?

08:42.370 --> 08:43.460
All the words you said

08:43.460 --> 08:45.120
will lead only one consequence.

08:45.140 --> 08:46.390
Xiao En will kill you for sure

08:46.410 --> 08:48.370
in less than a day.

09:22.610 --> 09:23.470
Your Excellency,

09:23.490 --> 09:24.290
this is a tiring march.

09:24.290 --> 09:25.470
Please go to the camp for a rest.

09:25.490 --> 09:26.880
We will proceed with the patrol.

09:26.900 --> 09:29.920
We'd better not neglect anything at the border of the states.

09:31.220 --> 09:32.510
Beiqi has been overwhelmed by our crackdown.

09:32.530 --> 09:34.400
There won't be anything bad in these days.

09:37.140 --> 09:38.200
Your Excellency,

09:38.220 --> 09:39.960
we found a cavalry ahead.

09:41.970 --> 09:42.730
Hold it!

09:42.730 --> 09:44.040
Put it down.

09:45.660 --> 09:47.480
Wait here in silence.

09:54.490 --> 09:56.330
Director Yan, there is an urgent edict.

10:07.100 --> 10:09.560
Report it back that I'll go in person.

10:09.580 --> 10:10.840
Yes!

10:51.850 --> 10:53.480
What do you want to do?

10:54.930 --> 10:56.080
I've applied poison

10:56.100 --> 10:58.010
to the dishes for you

10:59.050 --> 11:00.570
in the past days.

11:01.020 --> 11:03.680
The taste is good.

11:03.700 --> 11:05.210
But in retrospect,

11:05.490 --> 11:08.040
it seems I'm not paying any respect to you as a senior.

11:08.730 --> 11:10.390
So, you don't want to do it any more

11:10.410 --> 11:11.920
from today onwards?

11:15.410 --> 11:17.080
What are you doing?

11:17.930 --> 11:20.570
Here has been sieged airtightly.

11:21.020 --> 11:23.250
Senior, please cherish your life.

11:51.820 --> 11:53.080
Done!

12:02.970 --> 12:04.950
Is it used to kill Wang Qinian?

12:04.970 --> 12:06.370
Yes!

12:08.660 --> 12:10.020
Wang Qinian is

12:10.020 --> 12:11.570
my right hand.

12:16.580 --> 12:17.760
Wang,

12:17.780 --> 12:20.390
I think His Excellency is right.

12:20.410 --> 12:22.080
No, he is not!

12:22.370 --> 12:23.170
Both of his hands

12:23.170 --> 12:24.680
are tied up.

12:24.700 --> 12:26.330
How will he kill me?

12:27.260 --> 12:28.650
With this!

12:29.290 --> 12:30.520
Your Excellency!

12:30.660 --> 12:32.000
If I don't stop him,

12:32.020 --> 12:33.370
you'll die of this

12:33.370 --> 12:34.960
by tomorrow.

12:40.220 --> 12:42.370
But Your Excellency, I just don't understand

12:43.140 --> 12:45.320
why he has to kill me.

12:45.340 --> 12:46.900
You've read about Xiao En's life,

12:46.900 --> 12:47.760
right?

12:47.780 --> 12:50.210
Yes, I have. The Investigator's Office gave me his introduction.

12:50.490 --> 12:53.830
It says he is ruthless and vicious

12:53.850 --> 12:55.150
and full of scheming ideas.

12:55.170 --> 12:56.910
However, I still don't get it.

12:56.930 --> 12:57.950
I already told him

12:57.970 --> 12:59.840
I'm of little importance.

12:59.930 --> 13:01.200
Besides, killing me

13:01.220 --> 13:02.510
will not set him free.

13:02.530 --> 13:03.320
Then why will he

13:03.340 --> 13:04.800
still want to kill me?

13:04.820 --> 13:06.280
He is a human.

13:06.580 --> 13:08.440
Just think about it from his position.

13:08.460 --> 13:09.950
What emotions would you have

13:09.970 --> 13:11.120
if you were imprisoned for many years

13:11.140 --> 13:12.650
without day light?

13:15.140 --> 13:16.450
Anger!

13:17.260 --> 13:18.640
Grudges!

13:18.660 --> 13:19.760
Right?

13:19.780 --> 13:20.950
All of them!

13:20.970 --> 13:22.490
All these negative emotions

13:22.490 --> 13:23.640
have been suppressed for so many years.

13:23.660 --> 13:25.130
He needs to unleash them.

13:25.410 --> 13:26.830
Judging from his past behaviors on record,

13:26.850 --> 13:29.080
blood can alleviate his anger the best.

13:29.370 --> 13:32.130
So he will kill me

13:32.290 --> 13:35.510
just to unleash his anger?

13:35.530 --> 13:36.760
This journey to the north

13:36.780 --> 13:38.830
is a chance for Xiao En to escape.

13:38.850 --> 13:39.830
Once he kills

13:39.850 --> 13:40.830
anyone important of my side,

13:40.850 --> 13:42.000
he might lose his chance

13:42.020 --> 13:44.010
as I'll retaliate.

13:44.290 --> 13:45.730
So I told him

13:45.730 --> 13:48.130
you're my right hand.

13:49.900 --> 13:52.330
If you are right,

13:52.490 --> 13:54.600
will he seize me

13:54.730 --> 13:56.590
to threaten you?

13:56.610 --> 13:57.840
No!

13:58.100 --> 13:59.560
Xiao En won't take the risk

13:59.580 --> 14:01.370
unless it's someone that has blood tie with me.

14:01.490 --> 14:03.450
Once he loses it,

14:04.020 --> 14:05.690
he will be killed by numerous arrows.

14:05.930 --> 14:07.800
To survive

14:07.820 --> 14:08.950
is the top priority

14:08.970 --> 14:10.150
to Xiao En at the moment.

14:10.170 --> 14:10.880
Yes!

14:10.900 --> 14:12.770
Your Excellency also has poisoned him.

14:13.050 --> 14:14.200
So it doesn't have any risk at all

14:14.220 --> 14:16.160
in this sense.

14:49.460 --> 14:52.330
We'll take the route from Cangzhou to leave the country.

14:54.900 --> 14:56.000
Your Excellency,

14:56.020 --> 14:57.680
do we need to send someone

14:57.700 --> 14:59.450
to explore the way beforehand?

15:00.220 --> 15:02.480
The reason why His Excellency

15:02.580 --> 15:03.700
reveals it now is because

15:03.700 --> 15:05.320
he doesn't want more people to know.

15:05.340 --> 15:07.000
This journey will be dangerous.

15:07.020 --> 15:08.150
I have kept it to myself all the time

15:08.170 --> 15:10.370
to avoid interception ahead.

15:11.660 --> 15:13.510
Your Excellency is so careful.

15:13.530 --> 15:16.330
This journey will surely be safe.

15:32.900 --> 15:34.680
Young Master, everyone is ready.

15:34.700 --> 15:35.370
They are finally here.

15:35.370 --> 15:36.260
Get the horses ready. Let's chase them down!

15:36.260 --> 15:37.960
The gate has been closed.

15:41.610 --> 15:42.830
Hold this!

15:42.850 --> 15:45.720
We'll set out tomorrow then.

15:47.170 --> 15:48.950
Where are the assassins? Let me have a look.

15:48.970 --> 15:50.080
They are outside the gate.

15:50.100 --> 15:51.960
We'll meet tomorrow when we get out.

15:53.140 --> 15:54.120
Why didn't they come in?

15:54.140 --> 15:55.880
The things they bring won't be allowed

15:55.900 --> 15:57.330
through the gate.

15:59.170 --> 16:00.720
Do they bring weapons?

16:02.260 --> 16:04.080
Not really.

16:04.340 --> 16:06.840
Your Excellency will know once we meet tomorrow.

16:10.160 --> 16:12.160
=Capital City=

16:12.170 --> 16:14.150
Vegetables!

16:14.170 --> 16:14.970
Come and check it out!

16:14.970 --> 16:16.970
-Come and check it out! -Cheap vegetables!

16:16.970 --> 16:17.700
Cheap vegetables!

16:17.700 --> 16:20.480
-Cheap vegetables! -Fresh vegetables!

16:21.340 --> 16:23.250
Are these the assassins you find for me?

16:27.780 --> 16:28.910
Dad,

16:28.930 --> 16:31.000
I've hired a bunch of killers.

16:31.020 --> 16:32.530
They are the best of their kind.

16:32.530 --> 16:34.880
You must stop that.

16:34.900 --> 16:36.240
I'll follow behind him

16:36.260 --> 16:37.290
and initiate an attack

16:37.290 --> 16:38.370
to take his life

16:38.370 --> 16:39.650
when they get to the wilderness

16:40.580 --> 16:42.880
That's not possible.

16:42.900 --> 16:44.840
Don't do silly things.

16:47.410 --> 16:49.080
Fresh vegetables!

16:49.100 --> 16:51.370
Sweet and tasty!

16:54.580 --> 16:57.690
Are you sure they know how to kill?

16:58.370 --> 17:00.040
They do!

17:00.460 --> 17:02.480
Once bet, no regret!

17:03.170 --> 17:04.230
No! No! No!

17:04.250 --> 17:06.620
Sweet and tasty!

17:06.620 --> 17:08.800
Are they...

17:08.820 --> 17:10.080
selling vegetables?

17:10.100 --> 17:11.870
They bring those from the countryside.

17:11.890 --> 17:13.200
As they don't have road permit,

17:13.220 --> 17:14.560
they can't get through the gate

17:14.580 --> 17:16.910
and have to sell here.

17:16.930 --> 17:18.440
I want them here to kill...

17:18.740 --> 17:19.990
Kill people!

17:20.010 --> 17:21.480
They'll do that

17:21.500 --> 17:23.010
after selling up these.

17:26.980 --> 17:28.480
Your Excellency, look,

17:28.500 --> 17:31.010
that bag is prepared for you.

17:43.930 --> 17:45.510
Especially prepared for you.

17:45.530 --> 17:46.890
They were watered with our own liquid dung.

17:46.890 --> 17:48.320
Super tasty!

17:54.050 --> 17:54.800
Your Excellency,

17:54.820 --> 17:55.740
we're going beyond our domain of patrol

17:55.740 --> 17:57.170
if we walk further ahead.

17:57.290 --> 17:58.890
I need to kill someone.

17:59.340 --> 18:00.200
Follow me!

18:00.220 --> 18:01.930
Your Excellency is fleeing away?

18:02.580 --> 18:04.030
I'll be back after I kill that guy.

18:04.050 --> 18:05.770
I've got everything settled in the camp.

18:06.100 --> 18:08.410
It's a severe breach of law for frontier
force to go through the border.

18:09.620 --> 18:11.150
If I leave by myself,

18:11.170 --> 18:13.010
all of you will be guilty

18:13.250 --> 18:15.030
and your lives won't be spared.

18:15.050 --> 18:16.720
After I finish the killing and get back to the camp,

18:16.740 --> 18:18.320
I'll ensure your safety.

18:18.580 --> 18:20.440
If you are unwilling to go,

18:20.860 --> 18:22.320
you're free to leave.

18:25.860 --> 18:27.560
Who do Your Excellency want to kill?

18:27.740 --> 18:30.600
Don't ask. Just follow me!

18:30.620 --> 18:32.050
Where to?

18:32.220 --> 18:33.770
Cangzhou!

18:33.820 --> 18:35.030
The person we're going to kill

18:35.050 --> 18:38.050
will go through Cangzhou to Beiqi.

19:05.010 --> 19:07.230
This needle is hollow. The poison is inside.

19:07.250 --> 19:08.360
We have to do this

19:08.380 --> 19:09.930
for you are an elder senior.

19:10.340 --> 19:12.130
When do you plan to kill me?

19:15.530 --> 19:16.990
Senior, you must be muddled.

19:17.010 --> 19:19.130
I'm escorting you back to Beiqi.

19:19.530 --> 19:21.410
Chen Pingping won't set me free

19:21.410 --> 19:23.480
to the north.

19:23.530 --> 19:25.530
I don't know what the Head is thinking.

19:26.050 --> 19:28.320
I'm only taking care of my own assignment.

19:28.740 --> 19:31.130
You're not bad, young man!

19:31.980 --> 19:33.720
Thank you, Senior Xiao!

19:34.890 --> 19:37.480
Two cultivations a day

19:37.500 --> 19:38.910
without stop.

19:38.930 --> 19:40.270
I didn't have that kind of perseverance

19:40.290 --> 19:44.080
when I was your age.

19:45.500 --> 19:46.840
A slow sparrow should make an early start.

19:46.860 --> 19:48.080
I have no talent,

19:48.100 --> 19:49.650
so I have to rely on hard work.

19:49.700 --> 19:50.910
You have good talent

19:50.930 --> 19:53.030
and strong perseverance.

19:53.050 --> 19:55.630
If you can fight against the strong alone,

19:55.650 --> 19:56.980
your potential will be motivated

19:56.980 --> 19:58.410
to an even higher level.

19:58.930 --> 20:00.170
You can ask me

20:00.170 --> 20:01.960
if you still have anything in doubt.

20:05.100 --> 20:06.410
Stop the carriage!

20:07.860 --> 20:09.290
Done!

20:09.700 --> 20:11.270
Stay with him carefully.

20:11.290 --> 20:12.650
Yes!

20:25.250 --> 20:27.680
Do you want to chat about anything?

20:28.220 --> 20:29.650
I can chat with you.

20:41.380 --> 20:42.770
You...

20:44.930 --> 20:47.050
look very tired.

20:48.820 --> 20:50.960
Xiao En has been keeping inducing me all the way,

20:51.410 --> 20:52.800
which is indeed tiring.

20:54.530 --> 20:59.170
So, what do you come to me for?

20:59.220 --> 21:00.600
Nothing.

21:10.820 --> 21:13.930
Do you want me to massage for you?

21:20.290 --> 21:22.890
That's most kind of you.

21:26.250 --> 21:28.290
Turn around!

21:39.980 --> 21:41.650
Gently! Gently!

21:51.290 --> 21:53.410
Why do you heave a big sigh?

21:54.860 --> 21:56.560
It was I who arrested you.

21:58.530 --> 21:59.840
Yes!

22:02.860 --> 22:05.410
It was I who threatened you in the dungeon.

22:13.580 --> 22:14.990
So logically,

22:15.010 --> 22:17.080
it would be demanding for you not to hate me.

22:17.380 --> 22:19.200
Why do you treat me like this?

22:24.130 --> 22:27.480
I was knocked out by your poison on the pleasure boat.

22:28.010 --> 22:29.440
When I fled from the capital city,

22:29.460 --> 22:31.560
you chased me down in person.

22:31.930 --> 22:35.170
And in the dungeon, you interrogated me.

22:38.410 --> 22:40.050
Maybe it's my destiny

22:40.700 --> 22:42.770
to be bullied by you.

22:45.050 --> 22:46.600
Even so,

22:46.860 --> 22:47.820
it is you

22:47.820 --> 22:49.530
who saved my life in the end

22:49.700 --> 22:51.840
so that I can get out of the trouble.

22:53.620 --> 22:55.200
I don't know

22:55.860 --> 22:59.250
whether I should hate you or thank you in my heart.

23:02.250 --> 23:04.680
I tossed and turned on bed.

23:07.500 --> 23:10.130
Your shadow gets carved in my heart.

23:11.700 --> 23:13.890
I just couldn't tell.

23:16.530 --> 23:18.680
Why are you still sighing?

23:19.620 --> 23:22.250
Am I really that hateful?

23:37.290 --> 23:38.960
You said all those to me

23:39.580 --> 23:41.650
and wear such a facial expression now.

23:41.860 --> 23:43.840
Aren't you afraid that I will do something to you?

23:44.890 --> 23:47.080
I'm used to your bullying already.

23:49.500 --> 23:51.720
So you won't stop me

23:52.770 --> 23:54.440
if I really want to do anything to you?

23:55.500 --> 23:57.440
Don't you believe me given what has happened before?

23:57.460 --> 23:58.840
OK!

23:59.290 --> 24:01.150
Let me take a look

24:01.170 --> 24:02.800
at what is held in your left hand.

24:07.820 --> 24:09.440
You've been holding it

24:09.460 --> 24:11.500
ever since I stepped onto the carriage.

24:11.500 --> 24:13.290
That's exceptional love to it.

24:17.460 --> 24:18.410
Are Your Excellency laughing

24:18.410 --> 24:20.080
at my ignorance?

24:20.100 --> 24:22.030
I know you.

24:22.050 --> 24:23.530
Of course, Your Excellency know everything.

24:23.530 --> 24:24.840
Locked up in a deep dungeon

24:24.860 --> 24:26.680
without day light and hope of survival,

24:26.700 --> 24:27.700
every day you were full of worries

24:27.700 --> 24:29.650
about what will happen tomorrow.

24:29.740 --> 24:31.600
That's a most difficult time to go through.

24:32.130 --> 24:33.170
Despite that you're on the way

24:33.170 --> 24:34.720
back to Beiqi now,

24:35.170 --> 24:37.600
I am the one who is escorting you.

24:37.700 --> 24:38.870
After all, you took part in

24:38.890 --> 24:40.480
the Niulan Street assassination.

24:41.530 --> 24:43.480
Of course, you'll worry that I might retaliate you

24:43.500 --> 24:44.930
or kill you on the way,

24:45.500 --> 24:46.410
but what can you do

24:46.410 --> 24:47.750
as a weak lady?

24:47.770 --> 24:48.770
You can only ingratiate me

24:48.770 --> 24:49.800
like just now.

24:49.820 --> 24:50.770
You think it will give you

24:50.770 --> 24:52.220
more chances of surviving,

24:52.220 --> 24:53.320
right?

24:55.500 --> 24:57.360
And you are afraid I may give full
play to my animal disposition,

24:57.380 --> 24:58.220
so you hold it tightly

24:58.220 --> 24:59.680
in your hand

24:59.740 --> 25:01.560
because it is your only reliance

25:01.620 --> 25:04.440
at this moment.

25:04.650 --> 25:05.890
But both you and I understand that

25:05.890 --> 25:07.720
you can't stab me with it.

25:07.740 --> 25:08.720
You dare not to.

25:08.740 --> 25:10.150
You are afraid to hurt me,

25:10.170 --> 25:11.510
because once you do,

25:11.530 --> 25:13.200
you'll have no chance of surviving.

25:14.930 --> 25:16.930
Neither do you dare to spur yourself with it

25:17.290 --> 25:18.720
because you don't want to die.

25:18.740 --> 25:21.130
Right? Am I right?

25:25.980 --> 25:28.010
You can't stab me

25:28.050 --> 25:29.680
or yourself with it.

25:31.980 --> 25:33.840
In this case,

25:36.410 --> 25:38.480
what's the point of keeping it?

25:51.930 --> 25:53.050
Your life is grasped

25:53.050 --> 25:54.560
in other's hands.

25:56.170 --> 25:58.050
I know you feel very helpless.

25:59.340 --> 26:01.320
I also know you feel grueling.

26:05.500 --> 26:06.960
Miss Lili,

26:08.770 --> 26:10.600
this is the fault of the morals of the time.

26:13.010 --> 26:14.890
The fight between two states

26:16.100 --> 26:18.770
leaves a weak lady in such a hardship.

26:20.820 --> 26:22.890
I truly understand you.

26:23.930 --> 26:25.320
Just cry it out.

26:25.860 --> 26:27.530
Just cry!

26:28.700 --> 26:30.600
Don't hold it if you want to cry.

26:44.130 --> 26:46.930
Stop looking! Keep marching.

26:52.220 --> 26:55.250
She sounds very sad.

26:57.100 --> 26:58.630
What is his name?

26:58.650 --> 26:59.720
Si Lili.

26:59.740 --> 27:01.680
She is also a secret agent from Beiqi.

27:02.130 --> 27:04.170
I mean your master!

27:04.530 --> 27:05.770
You still don't remember

27:05.770 --> 27:07.130
what his name is?

27:07.500 --> 27:09.250
Fan Xian!

27:11.530 --> 27:13.010
Fan Xian!

27:14.380 --> 27:16.410
Now I remember it.

27:16.500 --> 27:20.440
He is bound to be a great enemy for Beiqi.

27:20.740 --> 27:23.650
Just because he can make a woman cry?

27:24.010 --> 27:26.930
It's not easy to take down your vigilance

27:27.530 --> 27:29.290
in the territory of your enemy.

27:40.250 --> 27:42.250
No one will hurt you on the way.

27:42.380 --> 27:45.170
Just calm down. I'm sending you back home.

27:45.700 --> 27:49.960
Actually, my home is not in Beiqi.

27:51.170 --> 27:54.960
My really name is Li Lisi.

27:55.290 --> 27:56.600
Li?

27:56.770 --> 27:58.410
The rumor is true.

27:58.930 --> 28:01.290
I'm descendent of the Nanqing imperial family.

28:03.170 --> 28:05.560
In that year, the Emperor Qing ascended the throne.

28:05.860 --> 28:08.080
Naturally, there were plenty of bloodbaths.

28:08.620 --> 28:11.440
My tribe were almost wiped out.

28:11.530 --> 28:14.030
So I fled to Beiqi with my family.

28:14.050 --> 28:16.010
You came to the capital city for revenge?

28:16.460 --> 28:18.170
I have a younger brother.

28:19.620 --> 28:21.890
He is my only kinsfolk.

28:22.340 --> 28:23.680
Everything I did

28:23.700 --> 28:25.800
was to make sure he lives well.

28:26.650 --> 28:29.080
Beiqi coerces you with your brother?

28:29.290 --> 28:30.650
Forget that.

28:30.890 --> 28:32.560
There is nothing to discuss about that.

28:39.290 --> 28:40.840
Maybe I can help you.

28:41.220 --> 28:42.200
With what?

28:42.220 --> 28:43.390
Find your younger brother

28:43.410 --> 28:45.080
and bring him back to Nanqing.

28:47.340 --> 28:48.840
That's not necessary.

28:49.170 --> 28:50.930
The result is the same.

28:51.580 --> 28:53.410
You didn't give away my secret

28:53.530 --> 28:54.290
when you were caught

28:54.290 --> 28:55.720
last time.

28:57.580 --> 28:59.410
I owe you one.

29:00.100 --> 29:01.480
So this time,

29:01.580 --> 29:02.960
you can ask me a question.

29:02.980 --> 29:03.960
Whatever it is.

29:03.980 --> 29:05.230
I'll answer it as an exception.

29:05.250 --> 29:06.930
Whatever it is?

29:07.930 --> 29:12.080
I heard you're getting engaged.

29:13.620 --> 29:15.250
Yeah!

29:15.410 --> 29:17.030
After I get back from Beiqi.

29:17.050 --> 29:18.410
Have you met?

29:18.530 --> 29:19.770
Yes!

29:22.530 --> 29:24.080
Do you like each other?

29:24.100 --> 29:25.320
Yes!

29:26.890 --> 29:29.050
Is that you want to ask?

29:31.700 --> 29:33.130
So wonderful!

29:34.100 --> 29:37.600
I wish you a long and happy marriage.

29:39.010 --> 29:40.320
It's OK now.

29:40.340 --> 29:42.290
I've got all the answers I need.

30:23.010 --> 30:23.770
Young Master!

30:23.770 --> 30:25.290
Fan Xian is too far away from us.

30:25.290 --> 30:25.930
Could you just

30:25.930 --> 30:26.700
go a bit faster?

30:26.700 --> 30:28.560
Yes! Yes! Yes!

30:28.980 --> 30:31.010
Young Master,

30:31.010 --> 30:32.800
your horse is dedicated to imperial ceremonies, right?

30:32.820 --> 30:33.800
What?

30:33.820 --> 30:35.080
Horses like this

30:35.170 --> 30:37.270
cannot go far as they are not fed with fine fodder.

30:37.290 --> 30:38.680
That's ridiculous!

30:38.770 --> 30:39.290
This is a supreme horse

30:39.290 --> 30:41.510
which I picked from a thousand others.

30:41.530 --> 30:42.750
It can't have any problems.

30:42.770 --> 30:44.130
Hurry up!

31:18.050 --> 31:20.890
It has relentless diarrhea and won't make it.

32:12.700 --> 32:14.460
Come back! Come back! Come back!

32:14.460 --> 32:15.720
Come back!

32:17.530 --> 32:19.250
After I catch up with you,

32:19.290 --> 32:20.840
you ditch me.

32:20.980 --> 32:21.800
And I will catch up with you again,

32:21.820 --> 32:23.250
and you ditch me again.

32:23.460 --> 32:24.680
I really can't catch up now.

32:24.700 --> 32:26.560
I'm about to collapse.

32:26.580 --> 32:27.930
Young Master,

32:28.220 --> 32:30.200
we're climbing mountains now

32:30.380 --> 32:31.720
as a short cut.

32:31.740 --> 32:32.990
We're supposed to catch Fan Xian

32:33.010 --> 32:34.320
at the border.

32:35.650 --> 32:37.410
Short cut?

32:38.250 --> 32:40.360
Good! Fine!

32:40.380 --> 32:43.440
But your speed is really too slow.

32:45.930 --> 32:47.010
Then what to do now?

32:47.010 --> 32:49.890
I... I'm too tired to move.

33:03.580 --> 33:05.840
Steadily! Steadily!

33:52.890 --> 33:55.770
Young Master, take some.

33:56.410 --> 33:57.770
No!

34:21.530 --> 34:23.600
It's too bitter.

34:24.010 --> 34:25.320
Young Master,

34:27.970 --> 34:29.800
you've been used to privileged life.

34:29.820 --> 34:31.360
This is too hard for you.

34:31.380 --> 34:33.400
You might as well give it up.

34:33.420 --> 34:34.760
No!

34:34.900 --> 34:36.520
I must kill Fan Xian.

34:38.340 --> 34:40.760
Alright! As long as you can take it.

34:45.970 --> 34:47.800
Fan Xian is with the mission.

34:47.820 --> 34:49.240
There must be guards.

34:51.970 --> 34:54.490
Do you bring any weapons?

34:58.530 --> 34:59.560
Yes!

34:59.580 --> 35:01.730
We do!

35:02.970 --> 35:04.690
Young Master wants to check out the weapons.

35:44.580 --> 35:46.840
What is this?

35:47.730 --> 35:48.640
Young Master,

35:48.660 --> 35:51.650
this is rolling pin, for rolling doughs.

36:08.380 --> 36:10.490
I've thought about it thoroughly.

36:10.580 --> 36:11.930
Everyone, listen to me!

36:12.820 --> 36:15.930
I've read all the books on art of war and I'm proficient on them.

36:16.340 --> 36:18.030
You shall follow my orders

36:18.050 --> 36:19.010
and take action accordingly.

36:19.010 --> 36:20.600
Kill Fan Xian when he is unprepared.

36:20.620 --> 36:22.040
Sure!

36:44.970 --> 36:46.470
We're close to the border.

36:46.490 --> 36:48.190
I've been doubtful over one thing

36:48.210 --> 36:49.600
and I want to ask you about that.

36:49.620 --> 36:50.970
Tell me about it.

36:52.730 --> 36:54.650
Why were you not killed at the time?

36:55.290 --> 36:57.730
I know a lot of important things.

36:59.420 --> 37:02.170
Interrogated for information. I got that.

37:04.250 --> 37:04.730
Then why

37:04.730 --> 37:06.800
didn't they cut your hands and feet?

37:07.660 --> 37:08.660
There should be a bottom line

37:08.660 --> 37:10.600
for everything.

37:11.100 --> 37:13.990
If it goes beyond the line that I can tolerate,

37:14.010 --> 37:15.520
I'll suicide.

37:17.140 --> 37:17.820
Before they get

37:17.820 --> 37:20.210
the information they want,

37:22.730 --> 37:25.130
Chen Pingping doesn't want me to die.

37:28.450 --> 37:30.120
That still doesn't make sense.

37:30.140 --> 37:31.490
What?

37:32.450 --> 37:33.430
Your bottom line

37:33.450 --> 37:35.240
perhaps should not be crossed at that time.

37:35.770 --> 37:38.280
But since they are sending you back to Beiqi now,

37:38.340 --> 37:39.840
why didn't they cut your hands and feet

37:39.860 --> 37:41.690
when you left the capital city?

37:42.690 --> 37:44.710
You still have some chance to survive now,

37:44.730 --> 37:46.430
so you won't commit suicide.

37:46.450 --> 37:48.050
Cutting your hands and feet now

37:48.050 --> 37:49.880
will make you less threatening on the way.

37:49.900 --> 37:51.370
That's reasonably

37:51.660 --> 37:54.240
the best for both worlds.

37:55.530 --> 37:56.840
Chen Pingping knows it

37:56.970 --> 37:59.240
better than me.

38:00.940 --> 38:02.250
Why did he become merciful to you

38:02.250 --> 38:03.800
all of a sudden?

38:04.580 --> 38:07.160
That's also the point I don't understand.

38:07.180 --> 38:09.450
Beiqi wants the live Xiao En.

38:10.210 --> 38:11.990
You might as well abrogate his martial arts

38:12.010 --> 38:12.820
rather than giving such a big source

38:12.820 --> 38:14.370
of disaster to Fan Xian.

38:15.690 --> 38:18.400
You don't need to worry about Fan Xian's safety.

38:18.420 --> 38:19.560
I know

38:19.580 --> 38:20.140
your black knights have been

38:20.140 --> 38:21.840
protecting Fan Xian during the way.

38:22.180 --> 38:22.940
However,

38:22.940 --> 38:24.990
Xiao En is not an easy person.

38:25.010 --> 38:26.760
How can I not worry about it?

38:37.690 --> 38:39.080
Put out the lamp!

38:39.100 --> 38:40.410
I don't care!

38:46.140 --> 38:48.450
Maybe they want me

38:48.690 --> 38:50.840
to deal with you.

38:51.050 --> 38:52.840
They want to take advantage of me

38:53.180 --> 38:55.650
to kill you as a promising young man.

38:57.340 --> 38:59.050
You don't need to instigate like this,

38:59.050 --> 39:00.320
Senior Xiao!

39:00.340 --> 39:02.800
Don't trust Chen Pingping too much.

39:02.820 --> 39:04.490
You'll regret it

39:05.210 --> 39:07.650
sooner or later.

39:26.690 --> 39:27.990
As you ordered,

39:28.010 --> 39:29.730
all the black knights have withdrawn.

39:30.140 --> 39:30.900
Nobody is protecting Fan Xian

39:30.900 --> 39:32.760
as of now.

39:32.940 --> 39:35.640
We got information the other day that

39:35.660 --> 39:37.180
Shangshan Hu traveled south

39:37.180 --> 39:38.230
with his personal guards

39:38.250 --> 39:40.320
and disappeared in the end.

39:40.660 --> 39:42.490
He must have gone to save Xiao En.

39:43.970 --> 39:45.030
Yes!

39:45.050 --> 39:47.410
Then he will run into Fan Xian for sure.

39:47.730 --> 39:49.580
Withdrawing the black knights now

39:49.580 --> 39:50.580
will leave Fan Xian high and dry

39:50.580 --> 39:51.920
against the Beiqi War God.

39:51.940 --> 39:53.600
Don't you take him as your nephew?

39:53.620 --> 39:54.670
You're jeopardizing his life

39:54.690 --> 39:57.170
by doing so.

39:58.380 --> 39:59.530
Don't let Fei Jie know

39:59.530 --> 40:01.270
about Shangshan Hu.

40:01.290 --> 40:03.730
What are you going to do to Fan Xian?

40:04.530 --> 40:06.210
He is a smart guy.

40:07.100 --> 40:08.580
It took me a lot of time

40:08.580 --> 40:09.690
and arrangements

40:09.690 --> 40:10.640
to win his trust.

40:10.660 --> 40:18.080
This day is finally about to come.

41:15.860 --> 41:17.280
Wang,

41:18.010 --> 41:20.210
His Excellency Fan wants to meet you.

41:26.420 --> 41:27.650
Your Excellency,

41:32.050 --> 41:33.860
Gao Da and the swordsmen under him

41:33.860 --> 41:35.080
are very reliable.

41:35.100 --> 41:36.920
You can trust them

41:36.940 --> 41:38.650
whatever you want to do.

41:39.180 --> 41:40.430
My dad said

41:40.450 --> 41:42.000
you are trustworthy.

41:42.660 --> 41:44.400
I need your help with one thing.

41:44.420 --> 41:46.170
At your service, Your Excellency!

41:46.210 --> 41:47.930
I need to take Xiao En away.

41:54.180 --> 41:55.560
What's that for?

41:55.730 --> 41:59.370
The Lady Ye used to travel with Xiao En.

41:59.580 --> 42:00.710
My mom?

42:00.730 --> 42:02.360
She also told me that

42:02.380 --> 42:04.360
she came to this world

42:04.380 --> 42:06.750
because of Xiao En.

42:06.770 --> 42:08.270
I need to ask him for something.

42:08.290 --> 42:10.280
And you're critically important for it.

42:26.420 --> 42:28.510
He is saved by people from Beiqi.

42:28.530 --> 42:29.710
Beiqi is in the wrong.

42:29.730 --> 42:30.510
They won't prevent us from

42:30.530 --> 42:31.800
taking Yan Bingyun back.

42:31.820 --> 42:32.920
Beiqi?

42:32.940 --> 42:34.640
Shangshan Hu is Xiao En's adoptive son.

42:34.660 --> 42:35.750
You know him, right?

42:35.770 --> 42:37.100
Your Excellency, are you in contact with him?

42:37.100 --> 42:38.760
I only want to borrow his name.

43:01.880 --> 43:05.460
In the river of history,

43:05.480 --> 43:08.950
time goes round and round.

43:11.760 --> 43:15.100
Memories about the former and present lives

43:15.120 --> 43:19.190
join each other in an endless way.

43:21.080 --> 43:23.700
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:23.720 --> 43:25.960
one season follows another in a flash,

43:25.960 --> 43:28.460
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:28.480 --> 43:30.080
I just can't give up

43:30.080 --> 43:33.420
to be with you for my whole life.

43:33.440 --> 43:38.910
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:40.160 --> 43:42.710
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:43.000 --> 43:45.040
Year after year in the wandering,

43:45.040 --> 43:47.700
I count the remaining years.

43:47.720 --> 43:49.900
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:49.920 --> 43:51.910
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:52.200 --> 43:54.590
I never feel regretful.

43:54.640 --> 43:56.000
In such a chaotic world,

43:56.000 --> 43:58.980
I still miss you as ever.

43:59.000 --> 44:01.950
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:02.240 --> 44:04.300
With a gentle heart,

44:04.320 --> 44:06.980
I cherish our remaining years.

44:07.000 --> 44:08.520
Even though we have to go through

44:08.520 --> 44:11.030
all the hardships along the journey,

44:11.160 --> 44:18.350
you always stay by my side,

44:18.440 --> 44:21.110
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:21.400 --> 44:23.480
Year after year in the wandering,

44:23.480 --> 44:26.140
I count the remaining years.

44:26.160 --> 44:28.300
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:28.320 --> 44:30.550
even though we end up the destiny,

44:30.760 --> 44:32.940
I never feel regretful.

44:32.960 --> 44:34.360
In such a chaotic world,

44:34.360 --> 44:37.420
I still miss you as ever.

44:37.440 --> 44:40.550
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:40.640 --> 44:42.780
With a gentle heart,

44:42.800 --> 44:45.500
I cherish our remaining years.

44:45.520 --> 44:46.960
Even though we have to go through

44:46.960 --> 44:49.620
all the hardships along the journey,

44:49.640 --> 44:58.400
you always stay by my side...
